Replaces: dwm
Description: dwm with the ShellOS configuration
 suckless dwm built with ShellOS's config.h: Super-key bindings shared with
 ShellOS's Hyprland, i3 and bspwm, the ShellOS colours, rofi as launcher and
 Alacritty as terminal, plus a session that starts the ShellOS X11 services.
